{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sOFJSuCmsx1795388696.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>Tesla特斯拉及SpaceX創辦人馬斯克警告，AI人工智能產業明年可能面臨嚴重資金短缺。</p><p></p><p>近期AI概念股股價大幅下挫，法國AI研究專家肖萊在網上發表帖文，提出市場對AI需求強勁，目前是罕有的買入機會，並提出幾隻AI概念股的預測市盈率只是兩倍多。</p><p></p><p>馬斯克在網上回應，提到要為龐大的算力設備上線、散熱及維持穩定運作極為困難，即使由設備穩定至足以產生收入之間，僅累積延後幾個月，單是營運資金就可能要額外數千億美元，質疑錢從何來。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:23:52.958718+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T22:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T18:52:42.389849+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:17:37.493832+00:00","content_hash":"641d113a55465a8401be808570b2bac7c8befecf4203798aee7231a4c6d6c9ed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:23:52.958718+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}